Model VI:  Combined Forecasts Models 


Finally, as described in Table III, I will now construct two combined forecast methods of the following forms:


1. Simple average combined forecasts model: This model is constructed by taking a simple average of NGC’s forecasts model and our last mixed model (Model V).


FAVG.COMB. =  .5*(FNGC + FMIXED)




2. Regression combined forecast model: This model is constructed by utilizing regression analysis to find the combined forecast


   FREG.COMB. = a0 + a1*FNGC + a2*FMIXED



where

  a0 = -890

  a1 =  0.20

  a2 =  0.83

FNGC = NGC’s benchmark forecasts for 1998 

FMIXED = our last  mixed model (Model V) forecast for 1998

